Description:
    Wires the Sentry webpack plugin into webpack.config.js. This is a hook
    sub-generator invoked automatically by the sentry<->webpack coupling; you
    normally do not run it directly.

Example:
    rails generate rolemodel:sentry_webpack

    This will inject the sentryWebpackPlugin into webpack.config.js (a no-op if
    webpack.config.js is missing or the plugin is already wired).
